Answer: You will need to have an activity with an `Intent.filter` of `android.intent.action.VIEW`.

Try and add the below into your android manifest:

\begin{code}
//<!-- **MUST** copy to an appropriate location first e.g. use Copy command -->
<activity android:name="com.example.InstallService">

    <intent-filter>
        <action android:name="android.intent.action.VIEW" />
        <category android:name="android.intent.category.DEFAULT" />
    </intent-filter>

</activity>
\end{code}

`com.example.InstallService` is your own preferece.  It does \strong{NOT} need the `.apk` extension (in fact it should not have the extention.

_

